OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after being hit by van
OL,4,Aon Edinburgh City Bypass as man
OL,5,Aarrested
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman has died after being hit by a
OL,8,Fvan on the Edinburgh City Bypass,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FThe 47-year-old woman was pronounced
OL,12,Fdead at the scene of the incident that
OL,13,Ftook place at about 21:00 on Wednesday
OL,14,Fbetween the Dreghorn junction and
OL,15,FHermiston Gait.
OL,17,FPolice said she was struck by a black
OL,18,FCitreon Berlingo and a 22-year-old man
OL,19,Fwas arrested in connection with a road
OL,20,Ftraffic offence. Her family have been
OL,21,Fmade aware.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
