OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after being hit by van
OL,4,Aon Edinburgh City Bypass as man
OL,5,Aarrested
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe bypass was closed in both
OL,8,Fdirections for about 18 hours for
OL,9,Finvestigations to take place and
OL,10,Freopened at 14:45. Police Scotland said
OL,11,Finquiries were ongoing to establish the
OL,12,Ffull circumstances.
